flowchart TB
accTitle: Identity and reachability are separate gates
accDescr: Employees from the office or home authenticate to Client VPN. Group authorization and routing permit a private application path, and security groups restrict the final access.
O[Office employee]:::inputData --> V[AWS Client VPN]:::decision
H[Home employee]:::inputData --> V
ID[Corporate identity provider]:::inputData -->|Federated authentication| V
V --> A{Authorized group<br/>and destination?}:::decision
A -->|No| D[Access denied]:::warning
A -->|Yes, route exists| SG[Application security group<br/>Allows Client VPN group]:::decision
SG --> APP[Private application IP]:::output
